WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:05.300
Welcome to Traders Journal, the complete desktop trading workspace created by Chethiya Rathnasekara.

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:13.300
Every trading record stays locked and private on your PC, protected by local authentication with zero cloud tracking.

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:21.300
Traders Journal gives you full control of your trading performance, journal entries, and broker connections in one private desktop application.

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:35.300
Connecting MetaTrader five is fast and seamless. Simply run the one-click sync command to automatically link your live terminal and stream trade history with zero manual configuration.

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:47.300
Scan your computer to detect all active MT5 accounts. Choose which trading accounts you want in your journal, and safely remove deleted accounts with permanent protection.

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:58.785
The Command Center provides instant clarity on your net profit, win rate, profit factor, and equity curve, updated in real time across all your trading accounts.

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:09.300
Log every position with precision. Capture your entries, exits, fees, and strategy tags, and track your daily consistency on the trading calendar.

00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:21.203
Master trader psychology with the daily journal. Attach chart screenshots, record your execution rating, and track mistakes to build unbreakable discipline.

00:01:22.800 --> 00:01:33.300
Deep dive into performance analytics. Compare strategies, symbols, and session times to uncover your true statistical edge and eliminate losing habits.

00:01:34.800 --> 00:01:43.300
Your financial data and trading records stay entirely on your local machine. Create encrypted JSON backups anytime with complete privacy and zero third-party cloud tracking.

00:01:44.800 --> 00:01:53.300
Make the journal uniquely yours with KING Edition. Personalize themes, configure monthly targets, and enjoy lifetime ownership with no subscriptions.

00:01:54.800 --> 00:02:04.320
Traders Journal. Master your trades, elevate your discipline, and own your journey. Created by Chethiya Rathnasekara.
